OL,3,GNEWSAReform MS Sarah Cooper-Lesadd
OL,4,Aplans to defect to Plaid Cymru
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlaid Cymru's ruling body is meeting
OL,7,FTuesday afternoon to discuss the
OL,8,Fdefection of a Reform MS to the party,
OL,9,FBBC Wales understands.
OL,11,FSarah Cooper-Lesadd is understood to
OL,12,Fhave been unhappy with Nigel Farage's
OL,13,Fparty for some time, as well as some of
OL,14,Fthe rhetoric used by some of its
OL,15,Fmembers.
OL,17,FBBC Wales was told the decision is
OL,18,Fsubject to approval by Plaid's national
OL,19,Fexecutive committee.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
