OL,3,GNEWSAReform MS Sarah Cooper-Lesadd
OL,4,Aplans to defect to Plaid Cymru
OL,5,
OL,6,FCooper-Lesadd's move will leave Reform
OL,7,Fwith 33 seats in the Welsh Parliament,
OL,8,Fand if agreed would mean Plaid have 44.
